# Adding songs

Use the `add-songs` skill. Run `node scripts/add-songs.js` — do not hand-edit this file.

- Fields: `id`, `status: "OK"`, `name`, `singers` (array)
- Keep provided ids; otherwise generate unique `r` + 5 alphanumeric ids
- After adding, commit `public/songs.json` and push unless the user says not to
